WEBVTT

00:04:56.750 --> 00:05:00.330
But this didn’t mean 
that the mission was successful.

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:04.080
The Mars Orbiter
had to revolve around Mars

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:11.100
for which it had to be placed
in its orbit, which is called

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:15.320
Mars Orbit Insertion
or MOI operation.

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:18.770
This is an extremely critical period

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:21.110
where if you miss, 
you miss completely.

00:05:21.110 --> 00:05:22.540
No more chances.

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:25.410
Being the Deputy Operation Director,

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:28.010
it was mine and my team’s responsibility

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:32.470
to ensure that the entire process 
happens on its set configuration.